<Page titleKey="privacyTitle"><div class="information-shell"><Header/><main class="prose"><section data-locale="en-US" lang="en-US"><a href="/">← Back to converter</a>
<h1>Your reading is yours.</h1>
<p>Conversion, text recognition, and cover generation happen in your browser. Documents, filenames, text, metadata, and cover images are not uploaded. There are no accounts, analytics, or server-side document storage.</p>
<h2>What is downloaded and what is cleared</h2>
<p>Your browser downloads the libraries, OCR models, and PDF processing resources from this site. Requests for these resources may appear in the hosting provider’s standard logs, along with your IP address and technical browser information. These requests do not contain your document.</p>
<p>One file is processed at a time. When you cancel, start another document, or close the page, workers are stopped and references and download links are released. The browser controls when memory is reclaimed; we do not promise forensic erasure of RAM. Files you download remain wherever you save them.</p>
<h2>Interface language</h2>
<p>On your first visit, the interface uses your browser’s preferred supported language: English (US) or Spanish. English (US) is used if neither is available. A language you choose manually is saved on this device and takes priority on future visits. This preference does not contain document information and is not sent to an external service.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>Advertising is disabled in this version. Enabling it requires AdSense approval, valid account identifiers, reviewed consent management, and a separate domain for the private converter. Advertising scripts can run only on the public page; the converter does not share document information with that page. Only fixed interface layout presets are sent to reserve space, and language preferences are received.</p>
<p>If advertising is enabled, providers may process browsing and consent information under their own policies. Declining advertising or blocking ads will not prevent conversion. No external AI service is used to process your documents.</p>
<h2>Protected files and limits</h2>
<p>Encrypted files and files that restrict copying are not converted. Damaged files, oversized documents, and documents that cannot be safely reconstructed are rejected. Only convert documents you are authorized to use.</p>
<h2>Typography</h2>
<p>The interface requests Comic Sans MS installed on your device. The font is not distributed with this site. If it is unavailable, a notice is shown and a system fallback is used. A properly licensed webfont can be added for a consistent appearance.</p>
